#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/fltk.xml:109
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of FLTK"
msgstr "Instalação do FLTK"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/fltk.xml:113
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The tar extraction directory is fltk-&fltk-version; and not fltk-&fltk-"
"version;-source as indicated by the tarball name."
msgstr ""
"O diretório de extração &quot;tar&quot; é &quot;fltk-&fltk-version;&quot; e "
"não &quot;fltk-&fltk-version;-source&quot; conforme indicado pelo nome do "
"&quot;tarball&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/fltk.xml:119
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>FLTK</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>FLTK</application>&quot; executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/fltk.xml:123
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed -i -e '/cat./d' documentation/Makefile       &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr    \\\n"
"            --enable-shared  &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed -i -e '/cat./d' documentation/Makefile        &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr    \\\n"
"            --enable-shared  &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/fltk.xml:130
#, xml-text
msgid "If you wish to create the API documentation, issue:"
msgstr ""
"Se você deseja criar a documentação da &quot;API&quot;, [então] emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/fltk.xml:133
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make -C documentation html</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>make -C documentation html</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/fltk.xml:136
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The tests for the package are interactive.  To execute the tests, run "
"<command>test/unittests</command>. In addition, there are 70 other "
"executable test programs in the <filename class='directory'>test</filename> "
"directory that can be run individually."
msgstr ""
"Os testes para o pacote são interativos. Para executar os testes, execute "
"&quot;<command>test/unittests</command>&quot;. Além disso, existem outros "
"setenta (70) aplicativos de teste executáveis no diretório &quot;<filename "
"class='directory'>test</filename>&quot; que podem ser executados "
"individualmente."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/fltk.xml:143
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Now, install the package and remove unneeded static libraries.  As the "
"&root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, instale o pacote e remova bibliotecas estáticas desnecessárias. Como "
"o(a) usuário(a) &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/fltk.xml:147
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make docdir=/usr/share/doc/fltk-&fltk-version; install &amp;&amp;\n"
"rm -vf /usr/lib/libfltk*.a</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make docdir=/usr/share/doc/fltk-&fltk-version; install &amp;&amp;\n"
"rm -vf /usr/lib/libfltk*.a</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/fltk.xml:151
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If desired, install some example games built as a part of the tests, extra "
"documentation and example programs.  As the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Se desejado, instale alguns jogos de exemplo construídos como parte dos "
"testes, documentação extra e programas de exemplo. Como o(a) usuário(a) "
"&root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/fltk.xml:156
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make -C test          docdir=/usr/share/doc/fltk-&fltk-version; install-linux &amp;&amp;\n"
"make -C documentation docdir=/usr/share/doc/fltk-&fltk-version; install-linux</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make -C test           docdir=/usr/share/doc/fltk-&fltk-version; install-linux &amp;&amp;\n"
"make -C documentation docdir=/usr/share/doc/fltk-&fltk-version; install-linux</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/fltk.xml:160
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you downloaded the optional html documentation, install it as the &root; "
"user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você baixou a documentação HTML opcional, instale-a como o(a) usuário(a) "
"&root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/fltk.xml:164
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>tar -C /usr/share/doc/fltk-&fltk-version; --strip-components=4 -xf ../fltk-&fltk-version;-docs-html.tar.gz\n"
"</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>tar -C /usr/share/doc/fltk-&fltk-version; --strip-components=4 -xf ../fltk-&fltk-version;-docs-html.tar.gz\n"
"</userinput>"

